START APP

Display Splash Screen
Wait 3 seconds
Open Main Screen

Create arrays:
ItemNames[]
Categories[]
Quantities[]
Comments[]

Add sample data to arrays

Main Screen:
Display Total Items Packed

When Add Gear button clicked:
    Read Item Name
    Read Category
    Read Quantity
    Read Comment

    IF any field is empty THEN
         Show error message
    ELSE
         Add values to arrays
         Show success message
    ENDIF

When View Details button clicked:
    Open Detailed View Screen

Detailed View Screen:
    FOR each item in arrays
        Display:
        Item Name
        Category
        Quantity
        Comment
    ENDFOR

When Back To Base button clicked:
    Return to Main Screen

END APP
